            "precision" : 100,
            "scale" : 0,
            "expFieldType" : "OUTPUT",
            "expression" : "-- 1. Check if LAST_NAME is NULL using ISNULL function.\n-- 2. If NULL, return UPPER and trimmed FIRST_NAME.\n-- 3. If not NULL, concatenate UPPER trimmed FIRST_NAME and LAST_NAME.\n-- 4. Use LTRIM and RTRIM for trimming instead of TRIM.\n\nIIF(\n  ISNULL(LAST_NAME),\n  UPPER(LTRIM(RTRIM(FIRST_NAME))),\n  UPPER(LTRIM(RTRIM(FIRST_NAME))) || ' ' || UPPER(LTRIM(RTRIM(LAST_NAME)))\n)",
            "userPrompt" : "IIF(\n  ISNULL(last_name),\n  UPPER(TRIM(first_name)),\n  UPPER(TRIM(first_name)) || ' ' || UPPER(TRIM(last_name))\n)\n\nMake this into valid expression for CDI IDMC. Using LTRIM RTRIM."
          },
          {
            "defaultValue" : "ERROR('transformation error')",
            "name" : "email_std",
            "platformType" : {
              "name" : "string"
            },
            "precision" : 100,
            "scale" : 0,
            "expFieldType" : "OUTPUT",
            "expression" : "-- 1. TRIM function removes leading and trailing spaces.\n-- 2. LOWER function converts the string to lowercase.\n-- 3. EMAIL is a string field, so no conversion needed.\n\nLOWER(LTRIM(RTRIM(EMAIL)))",
            "userPrompt" : "LOWER(TRIM(email))\n\nMake this valid expression."
          },
          {
            "defaultValue" : "ERROR('transformation error')",
            "name" : "phone_std",
            "platformType" : {
              "name" : "string"
            },
            "precision" : 100,
            "scale" : 0,
            "expFieldType" : "OUTPUT",
            "expression" : "-- 1. REG_REPLACE requires string input, PHONE is DECIMAL.\n-- 2. Convert PHONE to string using TO_CHAR.\n-- 3. Use REG_REPLACE to remove non-numeric characters.\n\nREG_REPLACE(TO_CHAR(PHONE), '[^0-9]', '')",
